(O102 - Park Machine)
(Moves to configured park position)
(Requires: [LOCATIONS] PARK_X, PARK_Y, PARK_Z in LinuxCNC INI)
(Falls back to X0 Y0 Z0 if [LOCATIONS] section is missing)

O102 sub

    (Read park position from LinuxCNC INI, default to origin)
    #<park_x> = #<_ini[LOCATIONS]PARK_X>
    #<park_y> = #<_ini[LOCATIONS]PARK_Y>
    #<park_z> = #<_ini[LOCATIONS]PARK_Z>

    (Safety: stop spindle and coolant)
    M5
    M9

    (Retract Z to park height, then move XY)
    G90
    G53 G0 Z#<park_z>
    G53 G0 X#<park_x> Y#<park_y>

    (MSG, Machine parked at X#<park_x> Y#<park_y> Z#<park_z>)

O102 endsub
M2
